@startuml
title RPG Character Creator - Registration and Password Recovery

actor Guest
boundary "React Frontend" as Web
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "Email Sender (SMTP)" as SMTP

group Register
    Guest -> Web: Submit display name, email, password
    Web -> Auth: Sign up
    Auth -> SMTP: Send confirmation email
    SMTP --> Guest: Verification link
    Guest -> Auth: Follow verification link
    Auth --> Web: Verified account flow
end

group Sign in
    Guest -> Web: Submit email and password
    Web -> Auth: Sign in
    alt Verified valid credentials
        Auth --> Web: Authenticated session
        Web --> Guest: Creator or My Character
    else Invalid credentials
        Auth --> Web: Authentication failure
        Web --> Guest: Generic login error
    end
end

group Forgot password
    Guest -> Web: Request reset with email
    Web -> Auth: Request managed reset email
    Auth -> SMTP: Send reset link if account is eligible
    Web --> Guest: Same confirmation message for any email
    SMTP --> Guest: Recovery link when applicable
    Guest -> Auth: Complete provider-managed reset flow
end

note over Web, Auth
  Never reveal account existence via login/reset messages.
  No passwords or reset tokens stored in app tables.
end note

@enduml